1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,348
'ok.' With
the period.

2
00:00:03,408 --> 00:00:03,968
Congratulations.

3
00:00:03,988 --> 00:00:04,558
You're in trouble.

4
00:00:04,578 --> 00:00:05,718
They typed 'ok'.

5
00:00:05,738 --> 00:00:07,298
Paused. Went back
for the period.

6
00:00:07,318 --> 00:00:08,896
Nobody does that
by accident.

7
00:00:08,916 --> 00:00:10,616
Same question.

8
00:00:10,636 --> 00:00:11,936
Three answers.

9
00:00:11,956 --> 00:00:12,762
One is a threat.

10
00:00:12,782 --> 00:00:14,902
'okay': happy.

11
00:00:14,922 --> 00:00:15,742
'ok':

12
00:00:15,762 --> 00:00:16,542
busy.

13
00:00:16,562 --> 00:00:18,502
'ok.': you
forgot something.

14
00:00:18,522 --> 00:00:19,762
Good luck.

15
00:00:19,808 --> 00:00:22,128
Except. One kind of
person breaks this

16
00:00:22,148 --> 00:00:23,388
rule.

17
00:00:23,616 --> 00:00:25,336
Dads. Bosses.

18
00:00:25,356 --> 00:00:27,156
People who sign
their texts.

19
00:00:27,176 --> 00:00:28,556
Their 'ok.'
is just 'ok'.

20
00:00:28,576 --> 00:00:29,564
Pattern first.

21
00:00:29,584 --> 00:00:30,564
Now you.

22
00:00:30,584 --> 00:00:31,944
A… or B?

23
00:00:31,964 --> 00:00:34,504
Careful. One of
them is your dad.

24
00:00:35,432 --> 00:00:37,852
A. First period
she's ever used.

25
00:00:37,872 --> 00:00:38,670
Dad's just Dad.

26
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:39,990
Bonus:

27
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,990
a lone 'k' is
a door closing.

28
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:42,530
On your face.

29
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:45,030
2/7: left on read.

